    "description": "<p>Unlike a small percentage of transhumanity, you did not escape off-world during the Fall, nor were you lucky enough to be killed. You survived for years, eking out an existence in the post-apocalyptic desolation of Earth while hiding from, and even fighting, the machines and twisted transhuman puppets that still lurked there. Only recently was your body rescued by scrappers or reclaimers or your egocast unwisely accepted by a trusting receiver.</p><p><strong>Suggested Motivations:</strong> +Survival, +/–Reclaiming Earth, –TITANs</p><p><strong>3 PP:</strong> +1 Moxie · Fray 20, Freerunning 30, Interest: (Choose One) 20, Infiltration 40, Kinetic Weapons 35, Language: (Choose One) 30, Pilot: Groundcraft 20, Profession: (Post- Apocalyptic Survival) 40, Scrounging 50</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Transhuman, p. 17.</em></p>",
